        "patchSetId": 6
      },
      "lineNbr": 346,
      "author": {
        "id": 8893
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-06-29T05:57:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We have renamed this parameter as `clip_dims` in https://aomedia-review.googlesource.com/c/aom/+/214541 to better reflect its purpose.  If this parameter is false, the block dimensions remain unchanged. If true, the function clips the block dimensions so they lie within the valid frame extent. Here, the frame extent depends on `do_border_pad`: when `do_border_pad` is 0, the frame dimensions are aligned to a multiple of 8; when `do_border_pad` is 1, they are aligned to a multiple of 2.",
      "parentUuid": "a7f6c0f4_cc79b988",
      "revId": "1c1c4abc43937d87732eef1ebb8e57e4e44eded6",
      "serverId": "e5514cf8-2d6e-3e29-adb4-24cd6dde4bf0"
    },
